      "role": "user",
      "content": "6000mg?? wow, that's a huge jump from what I was thinking. i'm a little nervous because since i've been feeling so depleted, my heart has started doing this really weird, rapid fluttering thing and i feel super lightheaded. is that just part of the 'loading' process or something i should be wary of?",
